  "id": "BIT-kibana-2026-72677",
  "summary": "Relative Path Traversal in Kibana Fleet Leading to Unauthorized Deletion of Users and Other Resources",
  "details": "Relative Path Traversal (CWE-23) in Kibana can lead to the unauthorized deletion of Kibana resources via Relative Path Traversal (CAPEC-139). Kibana Fleet accepted a user-supplied identifier for a Fleet Server host configuration without rejecting relative traversal sequences. The identifier is stored as provided and is later incorporated into the request that Kibana issues when that configuration is removed.",
